ss=\"ua-drop\">Drop an image here or <a href=\"#\">choose a file</a></div><div class=\"hint\">JPG or PNG, at least 1200 by 630 pixels</div></div><div class=\"f-block\"><label class=\"q\">Text <span class=\"req\">*</span></label><div class=\"ua-rte\"><div class=\"ua-rte-bar\"><b>B</b><i>I</i><span>Heading</span><span>Quote</span><span>Link</span></div><textarea rows=\"6\">A first British Parliamentary tournament means four teams of two speakers, seven minutes a speech and fifteen minutes of preparation. Here is what to do beforehand.</textarea></div></div><div class=\"f-block\"><label class=\"q\">On the home page</label><div class=\"opts\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> Show in the news block</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\"> Make it the announcement above the hero</label></div></div></div></main><footer class=\"ua-foot\"><div class=\"ua-foot-in ua-foot-in--3\"><div><a class=\"wordmark ua-foot-mark\" href=\"#\">UAdebates</a><p>Debate Federation of Ukraine</p><p>A debate community since 2011</p></div><div><b>Site</b><a href=\"#\">News</a><a href=\"#\">Calendar</a><a href=\"#\">Clubs</a><a href=\"#\">About</a></div><div><b>Platform</b><a href=\"#\">Cabinet (cab)</a><a href=\"#\">Privacy policy</a><a href=\"#\">Terms of use</a></div><div><b>Contact</b><a href=\"#\">ngo.dfu@uadebate.com</a><a href=\"#\">support@uadebate.com</a><a href=\"#\">t.me/fdu_ua</a></div></div></footer></div>"
